  "description": "Command line visual designer tool for creating Terminal.Gui C# applications.  Create and edit Termianl.Gui views as easily as you could with the Windows Forms Designer.  All generated code is contained in a separate file (e.g. MyControl.Designer.cs).  Run the tool by calling directly from the command line 'TerminalGuiDesigner'",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "TerminalGuiDesigner",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-03-14T20:04:46.13Z",
